# Agent handoff

At **session start**, read `docs/HANDOFF.md` before making changes. It has the current version, open PRs, and what the last agent left off.

At **session end**, update `docs/HANDOFF.md` with what you finished, what's blocked, branch/PR links, and the recommended next step.

Stable project context lives in `AGENTS.md` (architecture, deploy rules, test commands). Grok Build reads that file automatically.
